2026-07-27T08:56:20.8170979Z i /tmp/RtmpScz4Sh/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8171323Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8171722Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8172396Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8172948Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8173746Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:56:20.8174354Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
